    ct:exact_text "7.3.5 Records. Licensee shall maintain, and shall ensure that its Affiliates maintain, records, in sufficient detail, which shall be complete and accurate and shall fully and properly reflect all Net Sales and Gross Margins indicated in the quarterly reports described in Section 7.3.2. For each quarterly report, Licensee shall maintain records reflecting the Net Sales and Gross Margins contained in such quarterly report for [***] ([***]) years following the date that such quarterly report is delivered to Bioeq. The provisions of this Section 7.3.5 shall survive the expiration or termination of this Agreement for [***] ([***]) years." ;
